====== Unielec U7621-06 (U7621-06 / U7621-01)======
{{ media:unielec:unielec-u7621-06.jpg?200|Unielec U7621-06}}
The [[toh:hwdata:unielec:start|UniElec]] model [[toh:hwdata:unielec:unielec_u7621-06_256m_16m|U7621-06]] is a router with 4 gigabit LAN ports, 1 gigabit WAN port, and up to 2 wifi radios and LTE modem possibility. The platform is very flexible. It can be ordered with wifi card or without it. Board have multiple gpio and two GPLED.

The UniElec model U7621-01 is a router with 4 gigabit LAN ports, 1 gigabit WAN port and built in dual band wifi. It also has a mini-pcie slot for a LTE modem.

