===== Flash layout =====
The Stock PandorraBox Flash layout is:

^   Unielec U7621-06 Stock Flash Layout           ^^^^^^^^
^ Layer0       |  MX25L12805D  **//fullflash//** (mtdblock3) 16384KiB  |||||||
^ Layer1       |mtdblock0\\ **//u-boot//**\\ 192KiB |mtdblock1\\ **//u-boot-env//**\\ 64KiB |mtdblock2\\ **//Factory//**\\ 64KiB |mtdblock4\\ **//firmware//**\\ 16064KiB||||
^ Layer2       |:::|:::|:::|mtdblock5\\ **//Kernel//** |mtdblock6\\ **//RootFS//** ||mtdblock8\\ **//panic_oops//**\\ 64KiB|
^ Layer3       |:::|:::|:::|:::| \\ SquashFS |mtdblock7\\ **//RootFS_data//** |:::|

The OpenWrt Flash layout is:

^   Unielec U7621-06 OpenWrt Flash Layout           ^^^^^^^
^ Layer0       |  MX25L12805D  (mtd0) 16384KiB  ||||||
^ Layer1       |mtdblock0\\ **//bootloader//**\\ 192KiB |mtdblock1\\ **//config//**\\ 64KiB |mtdblock2\\ **//factory//**\\ 64KiB |mtdblock3\\ **//firmware//**\\ 16064KiB|||
^ Layer2       |:::|:::|:::|mtdblock4\\ **//Kernel//** |mtdblock5\\ **//RootFS//** ||
^ Layer3       |:::|:::|:::|:::| \\ SquashFS |mtdblock6\\ **//RootFS_data//** |



